## Third-party components (not covered by the MIT licence above)

This repository aggregates third-party deliveries that remain under their own
vendor licence terms:

- Vector MICROSAR basic software, RTE generator artefacts, DaVinci/SIP data
  (Vector Informatik GmbH — proprietary).
- Renesas P1x-C/X1x MCAL drivers and support files
  (Renesas Electronics Corporation — proprietary).
- Green Hills MULTI compiler/IDE delivery under `TL120A_Cplr/` and `TL121A_Ide/`
  (Green Hills Software — proprietary).
- Bundled Python runtime and other host tools under `TL*/` (their own licences).

The MIT licence applies to the project-owned content (in-house software
components, documentation site sources under `docs/`, scripts and glue). It
does not re-licence third-party code or binaries.
